      <ModuleCard name="crypto" color={T.rose} icon="🔐" tagline="Hashing, encryption, HMAC, cryptographically secure random">
        <EasyBox emoji="🔐" title="What is the crypto module?" color={T.rose}>
          The <code style={{ color: T.rose, fontFamily: mono }}>crypto</code> module wraps OpenSSL and gives you cryptographic tools: one-way hashing, HMAC signatures for webhook verification, symmetric encryption/decryption, and cryptographically secure random number/byte generation. Used everywhere security matters — authentication, data protection, token generation, webhook verification.
